WEBVTT

01:26.590 --> 01:29.770
[Glory]

01:30.770 --> 01:32.950
[Episode 6]

01:34.170 --> 01:35.970
-Let's go take a look.
-Let's go.

01:36.560 --> 01:37.120
Let's go.

01:39.200 --> 01:39.680
I...

01:39.680 --> 01:40.210
Let's go.

01:46.229 --> 01:46.840
Remember.

01:46.910 --> 01:48.509
Only pick the freshest bud heads.

01:48.509 --> 01:50.000
You must finish plucking one plant
in a single breath.

01:50.000 --> 01:50.870
Only by picking over 700 buds

01:50.870 --> 01:51.840
within 10 minutes

01:51.840 --> 01:53.229
can we deliver the goods in time at 5 PM.

01:53.229 --> 01:53.920
Got it.

01:58.759 --> 02:00.960
Just pluck it gently and don't pinch it!

02:01.640 --> 02:03.500
Nor can you clutch it in your palm!

02:04.110 --> 02:05.110
Don't touch that!

02:16.030 --> 02:16.680
Mr. Wang!

02:17.300 --> 02:18.630
You're quite cozy here.

02:20.520 --> 02:21.820
Look at those several fools.

02:21.820 --> 02:23.430
They don't know how to enjoy the pleasure.

02:23.430 --> 02:24.230
Have some tea.

02:24.760 --> 02:25.090
Okay.

02:25.100 --> 02:26.130
These playboys

02:26.400 --> 02:28.470
have no idea
how hard tea farmers have to work.

02:28.470 --> 02:30.560
Even I only came to
the plantation this time

02:30.560 --> 02:31.820
to check the accounts.

02:32.290 --> 02:33.350
But I've heard that

02:33.680 --> 02:36.060
the Pre-Qingming Tea here
is truly exceptional.

02:36.060 --> 02:37.970
Mr. Yang, won't you give it a try?

02:39.560 --> 02:41.310
It's like chicken eating fireflies.

02:41.310 --> 02:43.310
We both know what's really going on.

02:43.520 --> 02:44.400
Stop playing the tricks

02:44.400 --> 02:46.400
of brotherly respect in front of me.

03:22.190 --> 03:24.450
Young Masters, please learn carefully.

04:08.470 --> 04:09.270
Young Master!

04:11.590 --> 04:12.280
Young Master.

04:12.280 --> 04:14.540
Lady Shanbao is appraising tea outside.

04:14.710 --> 04:16.110
Lady Shanbao is outside.

04:17.040 --> 04:17.870
Hurry up. Let's go.

04:17.870 --> 04:18.870
Come on. Let's go, too.

04:18.870 --> 04:19.630
Young Master, let's go.

04:19.630 --> 04:20.070
Wait for me!

04:20.070 --> 04:20.600
Let's go.

04:22.240 --> 04:23.800
When I was a kid and saw my cousin
learning to fry tea leaves,

04:23.800 --> 04:25.160
I also cried and begged to learn it.

04:25.160 --> 04:26.360
But after less than half a month
of learning,

04:26.360 --> 04:27.000
my hands

04:27.000 --> 04:28.560
were covered with 7 or 8 large blisters.

04:28.560 --> 04:30.040
My mother held me in her arms and cried.

04:30.040 --> 04:31.430
Then she didn't allow me
to go to the tea fields again.

04:31.430 --> 04:32.360
Now it looks like

04:32.470 --> 04:34.040
learning to fry tea leaves
isn't that difficult after all.

04:34.040 --> 04:34.840
I'll go first.

04:35.470 --> 04:37.800
Young Master, when too many people
crowd around the hot stoves,

04:37.800 --> 04:39.240
you might scald your hands easily.

04:39.240 --> 04:41.800
Taking a different path
may bring unexpected joy.

04:41.800 --> 04:42.720
I won't learn it.

04:42.720 --> 04:43.310
You can learn it in place of me.

04:43.310 --> 04:44.310
I'm going to find my cousin now.

04:44.310 --> 04:45.360
You can learn it in place of me.

04:45.360 --> 04:46.390
No, Young Master.

05:08.760 --> 05:09.440
Sir.

05:10.430 --> 05:12.030
Could you let me give it a try?

05:17.510 --> 05:18.360
This year's tea leaves

05:18.360 --> 05:19.920
are indeed not as good as previous years.

05:19.920 --> 05:21.570
There has been too much rain
in the past few months.

05:21.570 --> 05:22.800
The tea leaves
have lost some of their aroma

05:22.800 --> 05:24.200
and the flavor is weaker.

05:25.420 --> 05:26.220
Lady Shanbao.

05:26.270 --> 05:27.880
The tea merchants from Shanxi
have arrived.

05:27.880 --> 05:30.010
They're waiting for tea upstairs now.

05:33.830 --> 05:34.510
Got it.

05:38.630 --> 05:40.000
Every year before the Qingming Festival,

05:40.000 --> 05:41.950
the Rong family
would always hold a tea party.

05:41.950 --> 05:43.720
This year, I'd also like to taste the tea

05:43.720 --> 05:44.870
which is made through you guys' skills.

05:44.870 --> 05:45.630
Skills?

05:46.480 --> 05:47.880
Lady Shanbao, so you mean

05:48.270 --> 05:49.950
you want us
to pick the tea leaves personally?

05:49.950 --> 05:50.560
Exactly.

05:51.310 --> 05:53.750
Pick and fry tea leaves personally.

05:54.720 --> 05:55.630
I see.

05:56.480 --> 05:58.140
Why didn't you say so earlier?

05:58.480 --> 05:59.720
Such rough work

06:00.750 --> 06:02.000
is certainly beyond my abilities.

06:02.000 --> 06:04.040
Ask that tea picker
to demonstrate it again.

06:04.040 --> 06:05.430
We haven't seen it clearly yet.

06:05.430 --> 06:06.310
Lady Shanbao hired me to do this

06:06.310 --> 06:07.600
with a large sum of money.

06:07.600 --> 06:09.000
I'm not your servant girl

06:09.120 --> 06:10.320
to be ordered around!

06:10.720 --> 06:12.430
-You...
-I explained it several times just now.

06:12.430 --> 06:13.750
If anyone doesn't understand,

06:13.750 --> 06:14.560
he might be

06:14.560 --> 06:15.960
a blind and deaf villain.

06:16.510 --> 06:17.390
How... How dare you speak like that?

06:17.390 --> 06:18.190
Lady Shanbao.

06:18.240 --> 06:19.800
There are quite many men in the village.

06:19.800 --> 06:21.390
They can
take care of children and work hard.

06:21.390 --> 06:23.190
There's a wide selection for you
to choose from.

06:23.190 --> 06:24.920
These are useless pretty boys.

06:25.630 --> 06:27.270
We can't let them work on this.

06:27.270 --> 06:28.480
Well... What does that mean?

06:28.480 --> 06:30.000
Your words are so offensive!

06:30.000 --> 06:30.950
-So offensive!
-So vulgar!

06:30.950 --> 06:31.680
How could you talk like that?

06:31.680 --> 06:33.080
Yi is from the mountains.

06:33.390 --> 06:35.430
She speaks frankly without ill intent.

06:35.430 --> 06:37.159
Gentlemen, please don't mind.

06:37.390 --> 06:38.040
Yi.

06:39.000 --> 06:40.920
These young masters
are all exceptional men

06:40.920 --> 06:42.250
and elites of our times.

06:42.390 --> 06:44.120
Such a simple matter as tea making,

06:44.120 --> 06:46.070
which you've explained repeatedly,

06:46.070 --> 06:48.390
certainly won't stump these smart people.

06:48.390 --> 06:49.070
They're

06:49.240 --> 06:51.040
just saying this out of modesty.

06:51.190 --> 06:52.790
Don't take it too seriously.

06:54.070 --> 06:55.190
Shanbao, I...

06:57.630 --> 06:59.480
The Rong family
treats all distinguished guests equally.

06:59.480 --> 07:01.490
Cousin, you're no exception, either.

07:01.490 --> 07:03.890
I'll wait for you all
at the tea party at 5 PM.

07:04.430 --> 07:05.630
Please excuse me now.

07:06.600 --> 07:08.280
Lady Shanbao! Lady Shanbao!

07:14.160 --> 07:15.630
My cousin is so ruthless.

07:16.040 --> 07:17.640
Can't even I be an exception?

07:17.950 --> 07:19.870
Young Masters, please.

07:22.630 --> 07:23.390
Let's go.

07:23.830 --> 07:25.120
Let's go.

07:25.360 --> 07:27.620
It's just picking and frying tea leaves.

07:27.680 --> 07:29.510
I don't think I'll be stumped.

07:49.720 --> 07:51.650
You've all tasted this year's tea.

07:52.040 --> 07:52.640
Later,

07:52.670 --> 07:54.870
I'll send some tea samples to your inns.

07:55.120 --> 07:55.950
Thank you.

07:56.240 --> 07:57.270
It's the same as previous years.

07:57.270 --> 07:58.159
I want 2000 jin.

08:00.000 --> 08:01.530
Lady Shanbao, you're back.

08:02.120 --> 08:03.310
It's been just a year,

08:03.310 --> 08:05.560
and now you have a fine gentleman
by your side.

08:05.560 --> 08:07.000
It's rare that he knows
how to do business, too.

08:07.000 --> 08:08.460
He's quite helpful to you.

08:08.800 --> 08:10.870
You two are truly meant to be together.

08:10.870 --> 08:11.930
Congratulations!

08:12.190 --> 08:13.430
Then we'll leave now.

08:27.190 --> 08:29.000
These merchants
travel all over the country.

08:29.000 --> 08:30.430
They speak and behave rudely.

08:30.430 --> 08:31.690
They were just joking.

08:32.240 --> 08:33.720
Young Master, please don't mind.

08:33.720 --> 08:36.380
Actually,
what they said isn't entirely wrong.

08:37.240 --> 08:39.620
Flowers attract butterflies,
and peacocks spread their tails.

08:39.620 --> 08:40.390
All these things I've done

08:40.390 --> 08:41.480
are to show you

08:42.360 --> 08:44.960
that I love tea
and know how to cultivate tea leaves.

08:44.960 --> 08:47.560
I also understand all aspects
of tea business.

08:47.790 --> 08:50.050
I'll be a good helper to you
in the future.

08:52.030 --> 08:54.160
You are truly diligent, Young Master.

09:01.600 --> 09:04.880
Business rewards honest people,
and Heaven rewards diligent people.

09:04.880 --> 09:06.080
I'll walk my own path,

09:06.510 --> 09:08.710
and I hope you'll also keep your promise

09:09.120 --> 09:10.580
by giving me a fair chance.

09:49.240 --> 09:49.770
Fusheng.

09:50.440 --> 09:51.270
How did you know

09:51.270 --> 09:52.670
Shanbao would set a test?

09:53.030 --> 09:53.870
I didn't know.

09:54.750 --> 09:55.880
But I could guess it.

09:56.790 --> 09:58.390
As soon as the young masters
entered the tea plantation,

09:58.390 --> 09:59.510
there was someone who meticulously

09:59.510 --> 10:00.720
taught you guys how to make tea.

10:00.720 --> 10:02.390
If you had paid close attention,

10:02.390 --> 10:04.670
you would have noticed something was off.

10:04.670 --> 10:06.910
It's also because Shanbao is shrewd
and cunning.

10:06.910 --> 10:08.670
She suddenly stroke back
when we were off guard.

10:08.670 --> 10:09.480
If I had known earlier,

10:09.480 --> 10:11.210
I would have taken your advice.

10:11.360 --> 10:12.510
Look at those two men.

10:12.510 --> 10:14.270
Both their families own tea plantations.

10:14.270 --> 10:15.600
This test is so unfair.

10:17.390 --> 10:19.630
It's said that picking tea leaves is easy,
but frying tea leaves is hard.

10:19.630 --> 10:20.490
Think about it.

10:20.510 --> 10:22.510
Mr. Xu's hands are covered with scalds.

10:22.510 --> 10:23.240
That's how he became

10:23.240 --> 10:24.670
skilled in frying tea leaves.

10:24.670 --> 10:26.800
Their hands look smooth and flawless.

10:27.200 --> 10:29.080
I don't think
they're much better than you.

10:29.080 --> 10:31.080
As long as you put more effort into it

10:31.120 --> 10:32.120
and don't slack off,

10:32.120 --> 10:33.980
Lady Shanbao will surely notice.

10:38.480 --> 10:40.080
If you really can't stand it,

10:40.390 --> 10:42.320
show your vulnerability when needed.

10:42.320 --> 10:44.920
Lady Shanbao
will be more concerned about you.

10:47.750 --> 10:48.390
Oh, no!

10:48.550 --> 10:49.750
Mr. Bai fainted!

10:49.870 --> 10:51.550
Yingsheng! Yingsheng!

10:52.150 --> 10:53.610
Really? He fainted again?

10:53.630 --> 10:54.320
Yingsheng!

10:57.270 --> 10:58.730
-How are you?
-Yingsheng!

10:58.870 --> 10:59.390
Are you alright?

10:59.390 --> 11:01.750
Yingsheng, why did you pass out?

11:02.000 --> 11:03.630
They're just bullying honest people.

11:03.630 --> 11:05.760
He has to pluck such a large area alone.

11:06.720 --> 11:08.630
I'll go find a doctor. Step aside!

11:11.870 --> 11:13.600
Step aside! Please step aside!

11:17.510 --> 11:18.150
Mr. Wen.

11:20.120 --> 11:20.920
What's wrong?

11:25.120 --> 11:26.650
He's usually not like this.

11:26.670 --> 11:27.870
I've told you this is

11:27.870 --> 11:28.600
the work for servants.

11:28.600 --> 11:29.960
He usually doesn't do these things.

11:29.960 --> 11:31.160
How could he stand it?

11:37.360 --> 11:38.760
Why didn't Yan come here?

11:39.270 --> 11:40.800
He only knows to exploit us.

11:41.300 --> 11:41.970
Darn it!

11:43.360 --> 11:44.550
He must be exhausted.

11:44.550 --> 11:46.030
Hurry!
Carry him to the tree shade for a rest.

11:46.030 --> 11:47.270
Alright. Come on.

11:47.270 --> 11:47.910
Come on. Let me do it. Lift him up.

11:47.910 --> 11:49.170
Come on. Give me a hand.

11:49.240 --> 11:49.900
Be careful!

11:50.200 --> 11:50.660
Come on.

11:52.750 --> 11:53.270
Come on.

11:53.600 --> 11:54.120
Sit.

11:59.080 --> 12:00.000
Here, Mr. Bai.

12:00.390 --> 12:01.250
Drink some tea.

12:03.080 --> 12:04.340
He should be fine, huh?

12:09.750 --> 12:10.680
Where is Mr. Wen?

12:11.320 --> 12:12.720
Are you alright, Mr. Bai?

12:16.080 --> 12:17.150
He went that way.

12:27.240 --> 12:27.960
Mr. Yan.

12:28.670 --> 12:31.530
Please watch over everyone
in the tea fields for me.

12:32.390 --> 12:33.150
I trust you.

12:40.670 --> 12:41.400
Don't worry.

12:50.550 --> 12:51.270
Mr. Wen!

12:52.240 --> 12:52.960
Mr. Wen!

12:58.390 --> 12:58.960
Mr. Wen!

13:12.970 --> 13:14.390
Mr. Wen! Mr. Wen!

13:15.550 --> 13:17.480
Fusheng, my legs are injured.

13:17.600 --> 13:18.930
Ask Shanbao to come now!

13:21.170 --> 13:21.830
Wait for me!

13:39.920 --> 13:40.780
What happened?

13:41.880 --> 13:43.360
Lady Shanbao, Mr. Wen is...

13:43.360 --> 13:45.000
Shanbao! Shanbao!

13:45.000 --> 13:45.750
I'm here!

13:46.060 --> 13:46.670
Shanbao!

13:49.120 --> 13:49.650
Shanbao!

13:50.840 --> 13:53.270
I think my legs are broken.

13:53.520 --> 13:54.320
Don't move.

13:54.710 --> 13:55.870
I'll ask people to come and save you.

13:55.870 --> 13:56.440
Don't go.

13:57.000 --> 13:58.080
Don't leave me alone

13:58.080 --> 13:58.600
here.

13:59.180 --> 14:00.910
Could you stay here

14:00.910 --> 14:01.840
and talk with me?

14:02.120 --> 14:02.980
If you talk with me,

14:02.980 --> 14:04.710
it won't be that painful for me.

14:06.320 --> 14:07.600
Talking won't help to ease the pain.

14:07.600 --> 14:09.730
I think you should save your strength.

14:13.140 --> 14:15.420
Lady Shanbao,
please help me tie this tighter.

14:15.420 --> 14:17.420
I'll go down and carry him on my back.

14:24.440 --> 14:25.640
You're quite clever.

14:26.440 --> 14:27.900
The mountain paths
are steep and difficult to walk,

14:27.900 --> 14:30.150
but people's hearts
are even more unpredictable.

14:30.150 --> 14:32.000
I'm entrusted with your important task,

14:32.000 --> 14:34.260
so I must deal with everything properly.

14:39.250 --> 14:40.000
Be careful.

15:06.080 --> 15:07.010
Watch your step.

15:30.450 --> 15:31.250
Hang in there.

16:00.190 --> 16:00.710
Wen.

16:02.670 --> 16:03.390
Shanbao.

16:14.950 --> 16:17.280
I'll help Mr. Wen down the mountain first.

16:34.220 --> 16:35.680
You shameless scoundrel!

16:35.750 --> 16:37.240
Where did you
get these ugly twigs and rotten leaves?

16:37.240 --> 16:39.080
Are you trying to muddle through
with these counterfeits?

16:39.080 --> 16:40.870
How dare you ruin my tea plantation?

16:40.870 --> 16:42.720
Even if
you were to offer me a lump of silver

16:42.720 --> 16:44.390
or knee down and call me Grandmother,

16:44.390 --> 16:46.140
I wouldn't acknowledge you as my grandson.

16:46.140 --> 16:47.140
-You...
-Guards.

16:48.190 --> 16:49.710
Take this troublemaker out.

16:49.710 --> 16:50.400
-Yes!
-Yes!

16:54.060 --> 16:55.750
My father is the magistrate of Huaiyin!

16:55.750 --> 16:57.170
You guys can't treat me like this!

16:57.170 --> 16:57.890
Let go of me!

17:00.510 --> 17:01.240
Which one?

17:02.850 --> 17:04.790
The one who went to Huaiyin
to take office 5 years ago

17:04.790 --> 17:06.430
and ran out of his travel money
while passing through Linji.

17:06.430 --> 17:07.270
Then he came to the Rong family

17:07.270 --> 17:08.400
to borrow 500 taels.

17:09.160 --> 17:10.589
After all, he's an official's son,

17:10.589 --> 17:12.589
so we should leave him some dignity.

17:14.920 --> 17:16.160
When your father saw Lady Shanbao,

17:16.160 --> 17:17.890
he knew he should show respect.

17:18.089 --> 17:20.020
How dare you behave so rudely here?

17:20.640 --> 17:21.480
Take him out.

17:23.109 --> 17:23.740
Yes!

17:27.150 --> 17:28.780
Let go of me! Let go of me!

17:29.830 --> 17:30.490
Let go of me!

17:31.640 --> 17:32.880
You guys can't treat me like this!

17:32.880 --> 17:34.740
Hurry! Put him in the front first.

17:37.200 --> 17:38.920
-What happened?
-What's wrong?

17:38.920 --> 17:39.550
How is he?

17:39.790 --> 17:41.050
-Mr. Wen.
-Take a look.

17:47.030 --> 17:48.240
Besides his legs and arms,

17:48.240 --> 17:50.240
I'm afraid
he may have wounds in his brain, too.

17:50.240 --> 17:52.370
Take my cousin back home immediately.

17:52.720 --> 17:53.160
Hurry!

18:07.720 --> 18:09.480
These people
went to the plantation normally.

18:09.480 --> 18:10.540
One of them fainted

18:10.790 --> 18:12.190
and one of them fell down.

18:12.590 --> 18:14.310
Blood stained the tea plantation,

18:14.310 --> 18:15.720
which might damage the owner's good luck

18:15.720 --> 18:16.650
and prosperity.

18:17.110 --> 18:18.920
They're all inauspicious people.

18:18.920 --> 18:20.000
This way, won't your chances of winning

18:20.000 --> 18:20.960
become bigger?

18:22.070 --> 18:24.110
Mr. Yang, you must be joking.

18:24.480 --> 18:26.000
The tea party will begin soon.

18:26.000 --> 18:27.110
Why are you still chattering?

18:27.110 --> 18:28.710
Hurry up and make the tea now!

18:29.090 --> 18:29.640
Alright.

18:34.830 --> 18:37.230
[Rong Mansion]

18:45.750 --> 18:47.000
Oh, my son!

18:48.880 --> 18:51.160
Can'er, oh, my dear Can'er!

18:52.920 --> 18:54.920
Are you feeling better now?

18:55.110 --> 18:56.790
Mother, why are you here?

18:57.830 --> 18:59.160
What reason could it be?

18:59.350 --> 19:01.810
Of course I'm here
to persuade you to go back.

19:03.720 --> 19:05.160
Please don't worry, Lady Shanbao.

19:05.160 --> 19:06.310
I'll just patiently persuade him

19:06.310 --> 19:07.370
to change his mind.

19:12.640 --> 19:13.880
Guard the door properly.

19:13.880 --> 19:14.540
-Yes.
-Yes.

19:17.110 --> 19:17.970
I won't go back.

19:18.750 --> 19:20.590
You came to the Rong family
without a word.

19:20.590 --> 19:21.750
If your father finds out about it,

19:21.750 --> 19:23.000
he'll definitely break your legs!

19:23.000 --> 19:23.750
It hurts, Mother!

19:23.750 --> 19:25.350
I'm injured and you're still hitting me?

19:25.350 --> 19:26.110
Let me take a look.

19:26.110 --> 19:27.030
I'm fine.

19:27.590 --> 19:28.390
You silly boy.

19:29.790 --> 19:30.720
But don't worry.

19:31.160 --> 19:32.750
All the letters from the Rong family

19:32.750 --> 19:33.400
have been

19:33.400 --> 19:34.460
intercepted by me.

19:34.910 --> 19:36.920
I didn't let your father
hear any news about it.

19:36.920 --> 19:37.850
Really, Mother?

19:39.310 --> 19:40.830
Well, the boys
from the Yang family and the He family

19:40.830 --> 19:41.560
are all here.

19:41.880 --> 19:42.590
How could our Wen family

19:42.590 --> 19:43.920
fall behind the others?

19:45.070 --> 19:46.270
You and Lady Shanbao

19:46.640 --> 19:47.790
have been close since childhood,

19:47.790 --> 19:49.270
with deep affection for each other.

19:49.270 --> 19:50.200
The Rong and Wen families

19:50.200 --> 19:51.270
became sworn relatives

19:51.270 --> 19:52.350
and often visit each other.

19:52.350 --> 19:53.440
If you two get married,

19:53.440 --> 19:54.640
it'll strengthen the bonds even further.

19:54.640 --> 19:56.960
It's such a wonderful thing
that can't even be achieved in dreams.

19:56.960 --> 19:59.400
It's all because
your father is pedantic and old-fashioned.

19:59.400 --> 20:00.960
He's afraid people will laugh at him

20:00.960 --> 20:02.550
and think that he's selling his son.

20:02.550 --> 20:03.480
What an old fool.

20:03.720 --> 20:05.070
The Wen family doesn't have
millions-of-tales family property

20:05.070 --> 20:06.030
to give to the son.

20:06.030 --> 20:08.440
This is a golden mountain in front of us.

20:09.750 --> 20:12.440
Mother, I don't care about
the Rong family's wealth.

20:12.440 --> 20:12.960
I just...

20:12.960 --> 20:14.830
I know you have sincere feelings.

20:15.440 --> 20:16.030
But...

20:16.550 --> 20:18.720
You have to beware of others
who have different intentions.

20:18.720 --> 20:20.640
The more kindly Lady Shanbao treats you,

20:20.640 --> 20:22.770
the more deeply others may resent you.

20:23.000 --> 20:24.550
They'll gang up to deal with you.

20:24.550 --> 20:25.070
You must

20:25.440 --> 20:27.790
be careful
and pay attention to everything.

20:27.790 --> 20:28.640
Don't fall into

20:28.640 --> 20:29.480
their traps.

20:31.030 --> 20:31.720
Bao

20:32.030 --> 20:33.960
was brought up by her grandmother.

20:34.200 --> 20:35.130
She's wariest of

20:35.240 --> 20:36.770
men with ulterior motives.

20:37.160 --> 20:38.920
The more aggressive and ruthless a man is,

20:38.920 --> 20:41.920
the more deeply
Shanbao will detest and beware of him.

20:42.240 --> 20:44.030
However, as for those who are guileless

20:44.030 --> 20:45.310
and have fallen victim to others' plots,

20:45.310 --> 20:47.640
Shanbao would be eagerer to protect them.

20:48.270 --> 20:49.720
Mother, don't worry.

20:50.110 --> 20:50.920
I understand

20:51.070 --> 20:52.600
all these things very well.

20:56.720 --> 20:57.640
I'm injured.

20:58.160 --> 21:00.220
Why hasn't Shanbao come to see me yet?

21:00.440 --> 21:01.040
Yuan Xiao.

21:01.200 --> 21:02.260
Where is my cousin?

21:03.450 --> 21:05.000
Lady Shanbao...

21:05.590 --> 21:06.540
Tell me now!

21:06.590 --> 21:08.070
Where is my cousin?

21:16.770 --> 21:18.600
Thank you for your concern, My Lady.

21:18.600 --> 21:19.670
I'm not injured.

21:20.880 --> 21:21.680
Oh, by the way,

21:22.110 --> 21:23.290
according to Mr. Wen,

21:23.290 --> 21:24.550
an unfamiliar servant

21:25.310 --> 21:26.720
lured him out

21:26.720 --> 21:28.120
at the name of his father.

21:28.160 --> 21:28.750
He was afraid that his father

21:28.750 --> 21:30.090
would make a scene,
which might be so embarrassing,

21:30.090 --> 21:32.290
so he agreed to meet in a secluded place.

21:32.350 --> 21:33.640
But unexpectedly, in the blink of an eye,

21:33.640 --> 21:35.310
that servant disappeared without a trace.

21:35.310 --> 21:36.970
He was ambushed by assassins.

21:37.750 --> 21:39.210
My cousin is kind-hearted

21:39.310 --> 21:41.640
and easily falls victim to others' plots.

21:41.640 --> 21:42.270
Indeed.

21:43.310 --> 21:45.400
In the future, whether to take sea routes
to sell tea

21:45.400 --> 21:47.750
or follow the caravans to travel
thousands of miles for tea trade,

21:47.750 --> 21:49.590
it's common
to encounter bandits and robbers.

21:49.590 --> 21:51.390
It's not easy to do tea business.

21:51.430 --> 21:52.160
Mr. Wen

21:52.480 --> 21:54.280
still trusts others too easily.

21:54.400 --> 21:56.480
You're always concerned about others.

21:56.480 --> 21:58.740
Why don't you think more about yourself?

22:26.160 --> 22:26.830
Thank you.

22:27.850 --> 22:29.850
Thank you for your concern, My Lady.

22:31.070 --> 22:32.930
Since you joined the Rong family,

22:33.070 --> 22:34.790
you've suffered many hardships

22:34.790 --> 22:36.390
and got injured constantly.

22:36.880 --> 22:37.740
Could it be that

22:38.680 --> 22:41.080
our destinies are incompatible by nature?

22:41.680 --> 22:42.400
My Lady,

22:43.070 --> 22:44.590
please stop teasing me.

22:47.400 --> 22:48.070
Jun Dai.

22:48.440 --> 22:48.830
Here!

22:49.330 --> 22:51.550
With your injuries,
it's quite inconvenient.

22:51.550 --> 22:52.070
Jun Dai,

22:53.240 --> 22:54.370
from today onwards,

22:54.590 --> 22:56.120
just stay here to serve him.

22:56.420 --> 22:58.220
Except for Steward Lu's orders,

22:58.640 --> 23:00.720
you don't need to
follow anyone else's commands.

23:00.720 --> 23:01.240
Yes!

23:02.310 --> 23:04.640
Steward Lu, let me apply medicine for you.

23:11.820 --> 23:14.400
Your ring is returned to you now.

23:20.280 --> 23:21.080
Lady Shanbao!

23:30.130 --> 23:31.730
Steward Lu, you're so lucky.

23:31.960 --> 23:33.640
I've been a servant in the Rong family
since childhood,

23:33.640 --> 23:34.640
but I've never seen Lady Shanbao

23:34.640 --> 23:35.960
be so attentive to anyone.

23:35.960 --> 23:38.440
It's obvious that in Lady Shanbao's mind,

23:38.550 --> 23:40.280
you're different from others.

23:41.440 --> 23:42.030
Really?

23:42.550 --> 23:43.110
Yes.

23:43.310 --> 23:44.350
If I'm lying,

23:44.350 --> 23:46.480
just let lightning strike me to death.

23:56.890 --> 23:58.440
So this was also sent by Lady Shanbao?

23:58.440 --> 23:59.030
Exactly.

23:59.660 --> 24:01.700
This is all top-quality
square-patterned Wu silk.

24:01.700 --> 24:03.030
You're so handsome

24:03.030 --> 24:04.200
with graceful manner.

24:04.200 --> 24:05.110
Even those people in silk clothes

24:05.110 --> 24:07.110
at the Xinfang Pavilion
can't compare with you.

24:07.110 --> 24:08.830
If you show up wearing these clothes,

24:08.830 --> 24:09.720
no matter how hard
they try to flatter you,

24:09.720 --> 24:11.650
they still can't compare with you.

24:12.780 --> 24:13.340
Alright.

24:16.330 --> 24:17.660
Apply the medicine now.

24:17.780 --> 24:18.510
I wouldn't dare to delay dealing with

24:18.510 --> 24:20.190
Lady Shanbao's important matters.

24:20.190 --> 24:20.830
Okay.

24:35.990 --> 24:38.450
How come
there aren't any February Orchids?

24:39.150 --> 24:40.640
This area is only planted with some

24:40.640 --> 24:42.470
valuable tea trees and flower varieties.

24:42.470 --> 24:44.620
No February Orchids
have ever been planted here.

24:44.620 --> 24:46.070
Yes, there were.

24:46.550 --> 24:48.160
They were some of them here before.

24:48.160 --> 24:50.160
I could smell them every day before.

24:50.360 --> 24:50.990
My Lady,

24:51.590 --> 24:54.000
February Orchids
are wildflowers from the countryside.

24:54.000 --> 24:55.680
How could they be worthy of
being planted in this garden?

24:55.680 --> 24:57.210
Perhaps you were mistaken.

24:57.530 --> 24:58.260
Give it to me.

25:03.280 --> 25:03.960
A breeze

25:03.960 --> 25:05.360
can bring its seeds here.

25:05.750 --> 25:08.240
Thousands of such flowers
can grow all over the hills.

25:08.240 --> 25:10.200
How would they be stopped by humans?

25:10.200 --> 25:11.130
Go find them now.

25:11.830 --> 25:12.880
I'll wait here.

25:14.000 --> 25:16.000
Go now! I'm telling you to go now!

25:16.550 --> 25:18.210
Yes! I'll go look for them now.

25:18.510 --> 25:19.970
Please wait here, My Lady.

25:40.640 --> 25:43.470
Mother, are there flowers here?

25:43.810 --> 25:45.410
These are February Orchids.

25:45.590 --> 25:48.250
There's a whole field
of February Orchids here.

25:48.970 --> 25:50.970
Mother, I like February Orchids.

25:53.170 --> 25:54.430
Let me pick one for you.

25:57.550 --> 25:59.410
Our Yunshu is the most beautiful.

26:00.830 --> 26:02.870
Mother, my eyes

26:02.890 --> 26:04.420
will never heal, will they?

26:07.160 --> 26:08.020
They will heal.

26:09.150 --> 26:11.240
Once your father
asks your grandmother for help

26:11.240 --> 26:12.680
and finds the best doctor in the world

26:12.680 --> 26:13.740
to treat your eyes,

26:14.230 --> 26:15.890
they will certainly be cured.

26:16.160 --> 26:17.550
Soon you'll move into

26:17.550 --> 26:19.160
a very big house.

26:19.640 --> 26:21.770
There will be delicious food, fun toys

26:22.070 --> 26:23.200
and your favorite

26:23.200 --> 26:24.480
beautiful beaded flowers.

26:24.480 --> 26:26.340
There will be all of those things.

26:28.350 --> 26:29.110
Then from now on,

26:29.110 --> 26:30.800
I won't wear these wildflowers anymore.

26:30.800 --> 26:33.600
I'm going to take you with me
to enjoy the good life.

27:06.960 --> 27:08.790
Miss, hold onto your cane.

27:08.830 --> 27:09.830
Let me help you up.

27:10.850 --> 27:11.850
It was right here.

27:12.750 --> 27:14.410
It was definitely right here.

27:25.320 --> 27:25.980
Wait for me.

27:52.210 --> 27:54.350
Miss, are you looking for this?

28:11.760 --> 28:13.420
L-Let me plant it back for you.

28:13.590 --> 28:15.520
Will it survive if we plant it back?

28:16.550 --> 28:18.080
Yes, it will. I'm sure of it.

28:37.820 --> 28:39.330
Alright. It's done.

29:01.780 --> 29:02.390
Miss.

29:03.920 --> 29:04.850
Wait here for me.

29:05.000 --> 29:07.200
I'll go ask someone to come and help you.

29:07.790 --> 29:09.590
Lady Yunshu, I couldn't find it.

29:16.270 --> 29:17.110
Who are you?

29:19.020 --> 29:20.880
I didn't know
you're Lady Yunshu from this mansion.

29:20.880 --> 29:22.900
Please forgive my ignorance and offense.

29:22.900 --> 29:25.100
I don't dare to disturb you any further.

29:25.150 --> 29:26.680
I'm Bai, and I'll leave now.

29:27.070 --> 29:28.200
Your surname is Bai?

29:28.790 --> 29:29.790
Are you the scholar

29:29.790 --> 29:31.920
who fainted in the martial arts arena?

29:33.020 --> 29:34.580
I'm not skilled in martial arts.

29:34.580 --> 29:36.070
I'm sorry for my poor performance.

29:36.070 --> 29:38.680
Hiding skill in clumsiness
and using retreat to advance.

29:38.680 --> 29:39.960
You are a smart man.

29:40.960 --> 29:41.880
Later, at the tea party,

29:41.880 --> 29:42.750
remember this.

29:43.250 --> 29:45.130
Drink more tea and speak less.

29:50.790 --> 29:52.470
Drink more tea and speak less.

29:53.310 --> 29:54.440
What does that mean?

30:11.720 --> 30:12.580
Bai Yingsheng.

30:13.440 --> 30:15.590
You fainted even while picking tea leaves.

30:15.590 --> 30:16.480
Your health

30:16.480 --> 30:17.920
is just too fragile.

30:18.260 --> 30:19.000
I thought

30:19.000 --> 30:20.270
you couldn't make it to this tea party.

30:20.270 --> 30:22.600
I was about to send someone
to check on you.

30:23.880 --> 30:25.410
Thank you for your concern.

30:25.510 --> 30:27.110
I was also afraid I couldn't make it.

30:27.110 --> 30:28.830
Thankfully, Lady Shanbao was kind enough

30:28.830 --> 30:31.160
to let me use the small tea room
in her mansion,

30:31.160 --> 30:32.620
so I barely made it in time.

30:36.480 --> 30:38.880
I wonder
what funny scenes we'll see today.

30:50.070 --> 30:50.680
Mr. Bai.

30:53.830 --> 30:54.400
My master

30:54.400 --> 30:56.400
heard that you were feeling unwell,

30:56.680 --> 30:57.310
so he specially ordered me

30:57.310 --> 30:58.970
to bring you these Suhe Pills.

30:59.160 --> 31:00.350
Take the pills with warm wine.

31:00.350 --> 31:02.210
They can help to regulate your organs,
harmonize your Qi and blood,

31:02.210 --> 31:03.350
and dispel impurities to calm your nerves.

31:03.350 --> 31:05.150
They can assist you
in restoring your health.

31:05.150 --> 31:07.310
Mr. Yan is so kind that I can't refuse.

31:17.410 --> 31:18.520
We were all sweating profusely

31:18.520 --> 31:19.780
in the tea plantation,

31:20.070 --> 31:21.030
but we didn't see Mr. Yan

31:21.030 --> 31:22.410
go there to pick tea leaves.

31:22.410 --> 31:24.600
Now it's time
for inspecting the tea in public.

31:24.600 --> 31:26.930
Don't flinch in the face of the challenge.

31:27.110 --> 31:29.440
The distinguished guests of Chongxi Hall

31:29.590 --> 31:31.830
can pass the test without making tea.

31:32.240 --> 31:33.960
They're 100 times better than us.

31:33.960 --> 31:36.310
You still need to
beware of their duplicity

31:36.310 --> 31:38.350
as they might speak ill of you
in front of Old Madam Rong

31:38.350 --> 31:40.210
to make you have nowhere to stand.

31:40.880 --> 31:42.140
Just try to speak less.

31:42.440 --> 31:43.000
You...

31:54.440 --> 31:55.590
We're just going to taste tea.

31:55.590 --> 31:57.920
These guys keep talking so sarcastically.

31:57.920 --> 31:59.850
If they're taken to a private room,

32:00.160 --> 32:01.620
they would be so annoying.

32:02.920 --> 32:04.640
While men are competing out of jealousy,

32:04.640 --> 32:06.510
they would
show their ugly sides inevitably.

32:06.510 --> 32:08.240
It's irritating to watch this.

32:08.400 --> 32:10.310
That's why Yun'e used the pretext
of being ill.

32:10.310 --> 32:12.170
Xiangling isn't coming, either.

32:12.240 --> 32:13.880
But Grandmother thinks that's not enough.

32:13.880 --> 32:15.200
She's even ordering each branch
of the family

32:15.200 --> 32:17.000
to select new candidates again.

32:17.930 --> 32:20.790
There will be quite a spectacle
in the Rong Mansion.

32:20.790 --> 32:22.110
Lady Shanbao is here!

32:42.590 --> 32:44.920
Some of you are older than me.

32:45.640 --> 32:47.400
I shouldn't be receiving such bows.

32:47.400 --> 32:49.400
Old Madam Rong is highly respected.

32:49.440 --> 32:51.880
You're hosting the banquet
on behalf of her.

32:51.880 --> 32:53.590
You're certainly supposed to
take the chief seat

32:53.590 --> 32:54.790
and receive our bows.

32:54.830 --> 32:56.230
No need for such modesty.

32:56.550 --> 32:57.350
Yes, indeed.

32:57.350 --> 32:58.000
That makes sense.

32:58.000 --> 32:58.400
Yes.

32:58.480 --> 32:59.830
Only after you take the chief seat

32:59.830 --> 33:01.160
will we dare to sit down.

33:02.070 --> 33:03.600
Everyone, please sit down.

33:16.110 --> 33:18.110
Since you're hosting this banquet,

33:18.300 --> 33:20.560
then I'd like to
be in charge of the music.

33:23.640 --> 33:25.370
Forgive me if there's anything

33:25.590 --> 33:26.920
I've overlooked.

33:27.650 --> 33:28.510
Play the music!

34:15.880 --> 34:16.679
Young Master.

34:18.070 --> 34:19.670
Young Master, what's wrong?

34:25.949 --> 34:28.659
I... I killed a constable.

34:29.719 --> 34:30.429
Did I...

34:39.980 --> 34:42.460
Huishan Spring Water! That's good stuff!

34:43.880 --> 34:45.480
These are the processed tea leaves

34:45.480 --> 34:46.230
the young masters personally

34:46.230 --> 34:48.090
made in the tea plantation today.

34:48.230 --> 34:50.139
The spring water also arrived yesterday.

34:50.139 --> 34:51.340
It's fresh and sweet,

34:51.630 --> 34:53.070
which is perfect for brewing tea.

34:53.070 --> 34:54.600
Everyone, please taste it.

35:14.480 --> 35:16.480
Good water! It's so refreshing!

35:17.190 --> 35:20.320
As the saying goes, it's clear enough
to reflect flesh and bones,

35:20.320 --> 35:22.550
and gargling with it
can help to revitalize the mind.

35:22.550 --> 35:23.760
This Huishan Spring Water

35:23.760 --> 35:25.670
is truly divine nectar
in the mortal world.

35:25.670 --> 35:27.800
It's clearly almost the same as usual.

35:27.950 --> 35:30.030
Perhaps there's something wrong
with my taste buds.

35:30.030 --> 35:31.630
No wonder people always say,

35:32.190 --> 35:34.590
"Taking the world's 2nd-best spring water

35:34.800 --> 35:37.590
to brew wine and drinking it
with immortals in Heaven."

35:37.590 --> 35:39.110
Now that we have this water to brew tea,

35:39.110 --> 35:40.230
how could there be

35:40.440 --> 35:41.770
anything wrong with it?

35:42.370 --> 35:43.840
It's all thanks to
Lady Shanbao's great luck,

35:43.840 --> 35:45.120
so we can taste this fine spring water.

35:45.120 --> 35:47.250
We should thank Lady Shanbao for that.

35:51.680 --> 35:52.670
Later, at the tea party,

35:52.670 --> 35:53.530
remember this.

35:53.700 --> 35:55.740
Drink more tea and speak less.

35:59.550 --> 36:01.550
How pretentious and hypocritical!

36:01.730 --> 36:02.630
The Huishan Spring Water

36:02.630 --> 36:04.320
was all distributed
as soon as it arrived that month.

36:04.320 --> 36:06.160
The maid only said it arrived yesterday.

36:06.160 --> 36:08.270
Has she ever mentioned
this is Huishan Spring Water?

36:08.270 --> 36:10.630
The jar
just contains ordinary spring water.

36:10.630 --> 36:12.840
You're just like
half-green radishes in June.

36:12.840 --> 36:15.000
You all have made such exaggerated claims.

36:15.000 --> 36:15.930
How ridiculous!

36:51.010 --> 36:53.050
The color is uneven and lackluster.

36:53.660 --> 36:54.920
It's the lowest grade.

37:01.550 --> 37:03.840
The color is sallow with ashen tones.

37:04.290 --> 37:05.690
It's the inferior grade.

37:12.500 --> 37:14.510
There are scorch marks.
It's the inferior grade.

37:14.510 --> 37:15.880
Stems and veins are exposed.

37:15.880 --> 37:16.960
The ratio is out of balance.

37:16.960 --> 37:17.590
It's the inferior grade.

37:17.590 --> 37:18.230
It's the inferior grade.

37:18.230 --> 37:19.110
It's the lowest grade.

37:19.110 --> 37:20.510
It's the inferior grade.

37:43.090 --> 37:45.610
It's greenish-yellow with poor luster.

37:46.480 --> 37:48.080
But it's barely acceptable.

37:48.760 --> 37:50.020
It's the medium grade.

37:50.260 --> 37:50.990
You can stay.

38:13.200 --> 38:16.730
The color is bright green
with even shapes and tender textures.

38:16.840 --> 38:17.900
It's the top grade.

38:19.070 --> 38:21.530
Thanks for your compliments, Lady Shanbao.

38:21.550 --> 38:22.800
Mr. Yan didn't go to the tea fields,

38:22.800 --> 38:23.730
and that's fine.

38:23.840 --> 38:24.660
But the He family

38:24.660 --> 38:26.380
is the manufacturer of Huqiu Tea.

38:26.380 --> 38:27.190
Lady Shanbao.

38:27.440 --> 38:28.840
How do you expect all of us

38:28.920 --> 38:29.990
to accept this?

38:30.280 --> 38:31.400
-That's right!
-That's right!

38:31.400 --> 38:32.400
It's unfair!

38:32.400 --> 38:33.280
How can we compete like this?

38:33.280 --> 38:34.320
Yes, it's unfair!

38:34.440 --> 38:35.240
That's right!

38:49.290 --> 38:50.620
The flavor is ordinary,

38:50.970 --> 38:52.880
but fortunately, it doesn't
have the smell of coarse impurities.

38:52.880 --> 38:54.510
It's also the medium grade tea.

38:54.510 --> 38:55.710
Let them take a look.

38:59.190 --> 39:00.540
I know little about tea.

39:00.880 --> 39:02.630
I've learned this from the tea woman

39:02.630 --> 39:03.960
in the Fangyuan Temple.

39:04.030 --> 39:05.690
I learned it for three months,

39:05.710 --> 39:07.840
but I only acquired a smattering of it.

39:09.430 --> 39:10.320
That's just it.

39:11.080 --> 39:12.840
When scholars enter the examination hall,

39:12.840 --> 39:15.360
some of them
don't understand poetry or classics,

39:15.360 --> 39:18.420
and some of them
didn't bring brush pens and inkstones.

39:18.760 --> 39:20.360
My family runs tea business.

39:20.590 --> 39:22.660
Knowing nothing about making tea,
you're here to participate in the test.

39:22.660 --> 39:24.710
How could you show your sincerity
in the marriage proposal?

39:24.710 --> 39:26.090
I asked you to go into the plantation

39:26.090 --> 39:26.880
because I wanted to give you guys

39:26.880 --> 39:28.510
a chance to make up for your mistakes.

39:28.510 --> 39:30.310
Yet you still didn't cherish it.

39:30.670 --> 39:31.320
Moreover,

39:31.760 --> 39:34.020
Mr. Yan practiced for years on Mount Meng

39:34.050 --> 39:35.800
and has mastered all tea arts
in the world.

39:35.800 --> 39:37.810
Lady Shanbao
didn't ask him to enter the plantation

39:37.810 --> 39:39.340
not because of favoritism,

39:39.660 --> 39:41.780
but to spare you all from embarrassment.

39:41.780 --> 39:43.880
Since you're
almost completely enlightened,

39:43.880 --> 39:44.630
after entering the tea plantation,

39:44.630 --> 39:46.550
you should have been more attentive.

39:46.550 --> 39:47.920
As for the early-spring fresh tea leaves
from my family,

39:47.920 --> 39:49.060
even if they had not been dried or fried

39:49.060 --> 39:50.110
and had just been cooked in the pot,

39:50.110 --> 39:51.320
it would still be the top grade.

39:51.320 --> 39:53.000
When you were frying the tea leaves,

39:53.000 --> 39:53.880
there were tea-making masters

39:53.880 --> 39:55.340
teaching you step by step.

39:55.380 --> 39:56.400
Even with such a demonstration,

39:56.400 --> 39:57.660
you still messed it up.

39:57.960 --> 39:59.650
You guys keep playing tricks
and slacking off

39:59.650 --> 40:01.180
and only excel in flattery.

40:01.360 --> 40:03.490
The Rong family doesn't lack yes-men.

40:03.630 --> 40:04.880
Get out of here now!

40:05.590 --> 40:06.880
-How could you talk like that?
-What do you mean?

40:06.880 --> 40:09.140
They're still our guests. Don't be rude.

40:10.190 --> 40:11.960
As for the young masters
who got the low grade,

40:11.960 --> 40:12.800
we've prepared small gifts

40:12.800 --> 40:13.760
in the room.

40:14.200 --> 40:16.240
There will be carriages
taking you to the dock.

40:16.240 --> 40:18.700
The Rong family
will not detain you further.

40:20.800 --> 40:21.330
Let's go.

40:22.470 --> 40:23.150
Let's go.

40:23.670 --> 40:24.200
Let's go.

40:25.230 --> 40:27.920
The selected candidates
for this round are...

40:28.970 --> 40:29.900
Mr. Yang,

40:30.550 --> 40:31.440
Mr. He

40:31.880 --> 40:32.710
and Mr. Bai.

40:34.870 --> 40:35.670
Lady Shanbao.

40:41.960 --> 40:44.560
There is still some tea
you haven't tasted yet.

40:58.510 --> 40:59.360
Who is he?

40:59.840 --> 41:00.840
He's Steward Lu.

41:00.960 --> 41:02.880
It looks like
I didn't have a discerning eye.

41:02.880 --> 41:04.800
I thought this man was quite ugly.

41:05.320 --> 41:06.470
Now that he has dressed up like this,

41:06.470 --> 41:08.000
he actually looks quite presentable.

41:08.000 --> 41:09.330
Who do you think you are?

41:09.570 --> 41:11.370
How dare you also serve tea here?

41:12.440 --> 41:14.710
Before leaving the mountain,
Mr. Wen repeatedly asked me to do this.

41:14.710 --> 41:16.670
He ordered me to prepare the tea
according to his instructions.

41:16.670 --> 41:18.070
Now he is seriously injured and bedridden,

41:18.070 --> 41:20.110
so I have to present the tea
on his behalf.

41:20.110 --> 41:20.910
Lady Shanbao.

41:21.590 --> 41:22.200
Please.

41:32.020 --> 41:34.950
It was overcooked a bit,
but it's still the top grade.

41:36.190 --> 41:37.590
Since it was overcooked,

41:38.230 --> 41:40.160
how can it be rated as the top grade?

41:45.800 --> 41:48.130
It has the common orchid-bean fragrance.

41:48.280 --> 41:49.810
It seems fresh from the pot.

41:50.290 --> 41:52.440
There's the dry scent of fire.

41:53.070 --> 41:55.590
There is indeed a unique roasted aroma.

41:56.820 --> 41:58.620
What did you do to the tea leaves?

41:59.360 --> 42:00.000
I...

42:05.070 --> 42:05.960
Mr. Wen

42:06.090 --> 42:07.920
noticed that the tea leaves had moisture,

42:07.920 --> 42:08.800
probably because of

42:08.800 --> 42:09.960
the recent rainy days.

42:09.960 --> 42:11.300
He specifically asked me
to roast the tea leaves again

42:11.300 --> 42:12.360
after frying them.

42:12.950 --> 42:14.800
However, the young masters
left too hurriedly

42:14.800 --> 42:15.600
and too early,

42:15.760 --> 42:16.440
so they didn't hear

42:16.440 --> 42:18.100
Mr. Xu's tea-making secrets.

42:18.630 --> 42:19.430
That's right.

42:23.970 --> 42:25.980
Look. Pay attention to this technique.

42:25.980 --> 42:26.840
Do it like this.

42:29.230 --> 42:29.710
Look.

42:34.760 --> 42:36.800
I'm impressed by your thorough thinking.

42:36.800 --> 42:38.800
You truly have a gift for making tea.

42:43.280 --> 42:45.150
It's all thanks to the guidance
of the experienced tea master.

42:45.150 --> 42:46.880
I don't dare to take any credit.

42:50.810 --> 42:51.960
Alright.

42:52.160 --> 42:53.640
Plus Mr. Wen,

42:53.670 --> 42:55.880
the number is enough for the Mahjong game.

42:55.880 --> 42:56.880
They're all talented men.

42:56.880 --> 42:58.550
Yet we must select just one
from these five men.

42:58.550 --> 42:59.030
Even I think

42:59.030 --> 43:01.360
this is a tricky problem for you, Shanbao.

43:02.030 --> 43:03.560
There are not only five men.

43:03.680 --> 43:05.080
I think there are six men.

43:12.950 --> 43:16.410
The Tea Ancestor Festival Ceremony
will be held in seven days.

43:16.950 --> 43:20.480
The Rong family sincerely invites
all young masters to attend.

43:32.100 --> 43:33.100
Stop right there!

43:41.550 --> 43:42.280
Ms. Yan.

43:43.190 --> 43:45.290
The Rong family
has set rules for everything.

43:45.290 --> 43:47.420
Everyone must strictly follow these rules.

43:47.420 --> 43:49.000
What kind of occasion
do you think the tea party is?

43:49.000 --> 43:50.160
You can't go there.

43:50.510 --> 43:51.920
I don't dare to disobey the rules

43:51.920 --> 43:52.920
set by you.

43:53.630 --> 43:56.310
But marking the boat
won't help to find a lost sword.

43:56.310 --> 43:58.360
Rules must also adapt to
changing circumstances.

43:58.360 --> 44:00.030
Sometimes, to complete our tasks properly,

44:00.030 --> 44:01.280
servants like us

44:01.800 --> 44:03.320
have to add salt when the flavor is bland

44:03.320 --> 44:04.850
or reduce the heat when it boils over.

44:04.850 --> 44:05.920
We don't always have the time

44:05.920 --> 44:07.520
to report everything to you.

44:08.440 --> 44:09.590
Please forgive me, Ma'am.

44:09.590 --> 44:10.990
How dare you talk so much?

44:11.070 --> 44:12.150
Who gave you the guts

44:12.150 --> 44:14.210
to be so disrespectful in front of me?

44:14.440 --> 44:15.500
I gave him the guts.

46:49.420 --> 46:51.740
[Tea Leaf Picking Skills]

46:55.000 --> 46:57.200
Just pluck it gently and don't pinch it!

46:57.780 --> 46:59.640
Nor can you clutch it in your palm!

46:59.800 --> 47:01.480
During the Ming Dynasty,
there were already strict standards

47:01.480 --> 47:03.190
for high-class tea leaf harvesting,

47:03.190 --> 47:04.840
especially for tribute tea leaves,

47:04.840 --> 47:07.700
which are premium tea leaves
classified by grades.

47:08.890 --> 47:10.290
Take only one bud with one leaf

47:10.290 --> 47:12.230
or one bud with two newly unfurled leaves.

47:12.230 --> 47:13.490
The length of the bud head must

47:13.490 --> 47:14.820
exceed the leaf length.

47:14.900 --> 47:15.860
The bud must be longer than the leaf.

47:15.100 --> 47:16.050
[Single Bud: The highest picking standard
with the highest tenderness.]

47:16.100 --> 47:17.050
[It's usually used to
make top green tea, white tea, etc.]

47:18.060 --> 47:19.080
As for the first-grade tea,

47:19.080 --> 47:21.620
it mainly consists of one bud
with one or two newly unfurled leaves.

47:21.620 --> 47:22.910
The bud must be as long as the leaf.

47:21.840 --> 47:22.010
[One Bud and One Leaf:
The classic top-quality grade]

47:22.050 --> 47:22.500
[It balances the freshness and fragrance.]

47:22.550 --> 47:23.210
[It's widely used for
high-class green tea, yellow tea, etc.]

47:23.230 --> 47:23.700
[One Bud and Two Leaves:
The taste is usually mellower.]

47:23.400 --> 47:25.120
There are strict requirements
for the appearance, too.

47:23.750 --> 47:24.680
[It's the top-grade ingredient
of many types of black tea.]

47:25.440 --> 47:27.260
Buds and leaves
must be intact with even shapes

47:27.260 --> 47:27.970
and no damage.

47:27.970 --> 47:29.390
There mustn't be any mature leaves,

47:29.390 --> 47:31.990
tea stems or non-tea impurities
mixed in them.

47:32.620 --> 47:35.110
The picking techniques
also require special attention.

47:35.110 --> 47:37.280
When you pick tea leaves,
the palm should face down,

47:37.280 --> 47:39.360
with your thumb and index finger
forming the shape of a pincer.

47:39.360 --> 47:41.610
Precisely grip the base
of the tender stem.

47:41.610 --> 47:43.670
Gently pull it upward to break it off.

47:43.790 --> 47:45.510
Avoid damaging it with fingernails.

47:45.510 --> 47:46.600
Once you pick the buds and leaves,

47:46.600 --> 47:48.450
put them
into the ventilated bamboo basket at once.

47:48.450 --> 47:50.620
Avoiding compression
from being held in hand.

47:50.620 --> 47:52.890
Tea leaf pickers
need to undergo rigorous training.

47:52.890 --> 47:54.970
Only a few jin of fresh leaves
can be acquired every day.

47:54.970 --> 47:56.550
Under this strict selection system,

47:56.550 --> 47:58.580
Ming Dynasty's famous tea leaves
were created

47:58.580 --> 47:59.690
to be as green as jade

47:59.690 --> 48:01.480
and have fragrance like orchids.
